UNOFFICIAL FORK
===============
This is a personal fork of the caption bundle by Axel Sommerfeldt
(https://gitlab.com/axelsommerfeldt/caption). It is not an official
release and not on CTAN. Branches:

fixes-combined
    The upstream version plus bug fixes for upstream issues #82, #147,
    #171, #177, #181 and #184 (the fix for #184 has since been merged
    upstream). Each fix is also available as a separate branch.
caption-v3.7 (this branch)
    fixes-combined plus support for tagged PDF (\DocumentMetadata).
    The generated files in tex/ are not updated; build them from
    source/ with "tex caption.ins" (test.sh uses tex/*.sty).
poc-caption4
    Experiments with what caption needs from the LaTeX kernel, and
    proposals for kernel interfaces so that caption no longer redefines
    \caption, \@caption and \@xfloat: see poc/PROPOSALS.md there.
poc-b2
    caption using the proposed interfaces. It needs a kernel built from
    branch b2-split of https://github.com/mark-vis/latex2e.
poc-kernel-interfaces
    The same for an earlier version of the proposals (kernel branch
    poc-kernel-interfaces of that repository).

The original README follows.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

==========================================================================

The `caption' package bundle
Release 2025-xx-xx
Copyright (C) 1994-2025 Axel Sommerfeldt (axel.sommerfeldt@f-m.fm)

License: LPPL = LaTeX Project Public Licence
Maintenance Status: maintained (by Axel Sommerfeldt)

Note:
  Although the maintenance status is still "maintained" this package
  is basically unmaintained since I will neither do bugfixes nor implement
  new features. I will just finish the new documentation and will mark
  it as "unmaintained" afterwards.
  If you want to become the maintainer of this package bundle just take it
  and drop me an e-mail so I'm informed about this, and can still
  contribute to the new documentation (if desirable).

Home page:
  https://gitlab.com/axelsommerfeldt/caption

If you need help for installation please visit:
  https://texfaq.org/FAQ-inst-miktexstar
  https://texfaq.org/FAQ-installthings
  https://texfaq.org/FAQ-privinst

If you need help using these packages please visit:
